<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD FOR AUSTRALIA VERSUS TRANSVAAL MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD FOR AUSTRALIA VERSUS TRANSVAAL MATCH.</headline>
